  "notes": "First released model of the Nemotron 3 generation; Super and Ultra were announced the same day and expected in the first half of 2026. Hybrid Mamba-Transformer mixture-of-experts design. Not to be confused with the 2023 model Nemotron-3 8B, which shares the number 3; bare Nemotron 3 is therefore set to never. Later Nemotron 3 Nano models may share the name stem; the matcher longest-alias rule should keep them apart."
